   GET  /api/lenders               - List lenders (paginated)
   GET  /api/lenders/stats         - Lender statistics

🤖 Agent Workspace Endpoints:
   GET  /api/agents/workspaces          - List agent workspaces
   GET  /api/agents/workspaces/{id}     - Get agent workspace
   GET  /api/agents/workspaces/{id}/tasks      - Get agent tasks
   POST /api/agents/workspaces/{id}/tasks      - Create task
   GET  /api/agents/workspaces/{id}/memory     - Get agent memory
   GET  /api/agents/workspaces/{id}/conversations  - Get conversations
   GET  /api/agents/commanders          - List commanders
   GET  /api/agents/commanders/{id}/dashboard  - Commander dashboard

📝 Obsidian Integration (READ ONLY):
   GET  /api/obsidian/status        - Vault connection status
   GET  /api/obsidian/files         - List files with filters
   GET  /api/obsidian/files/{path}  - Get file content (read)
   POST /api/obsidian/search        - Search vault (read)
   GET  /api/obsidian/folders       - List folders (read)

